{"articleNo":"225357","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=225357&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] [사단법인 3D프린팅산업협회] 2019 이공계대학 3D프린팅전문가 양성과정 연수생모집","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2019.05.31","hit":"10515","attachments":[{"name":"2019 이공계 전문기술 연수과정 신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=225357&attachNo=80170"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움,dotum; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">개요</span></strong></strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"> : 3D프린팅 전문인력 양성과정</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br><span style=\"font-family: 돋움,dotum; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">목적</span></strong></strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"> : 이공계 대졸자의 취업난과 3D프린팅 산업계 전문기술 인력부족을 해소하기 위해</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;기업 맞춤형 인력양성을 통한 취업연계</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><br></strong></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움,dotum; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">대상</span></strong></strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"> : 이공계 대졸 미취업자 및 2019. 08 졸업예정자 (만 34세 이하), 정부지원 미지원자</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><br></strong></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움,dotum; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">장소</span></strong></strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"> : 경북 구미시 경북테크노벨리 3D프린팅제조혁신센터(신평동 구 금오공과대학교 내)</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움,dotum; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움,dotum; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">신청방법</span></strong></strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"> : 홈페이지(</span><a href=\"http://www.3dpia.org/\" target=\"_blank\" data-cke-saved-href=\"http://www.3dpia.org/\"><font color=\"#0066cc\" face=\"돋움\"><strong><u><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">www.3dpia.org</span></u></strong></font></a><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">) 신청 양식 작성 후 이메일 보내기(</span><a href=\"mailto:3dpia@3dpia.org\"><strong><u><font color=\"#0066cc\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">3dpia@3dpia.org</span></font></u></strong></a><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움,dotum; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">신청기간</span></strong></strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"> :&nbsp;2019. 6. 14. 까지(1차면접 종료/2차면접 모집중)</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><br></strong></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움,dotum; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움,dotum; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">문의처</span></strong></strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"> : (